00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:49.300
These little spacecraft each no bigger than a shoebox are packed with sensors to monitor space

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:54.040
weather and keep track of objects moving through low-earth orbit. Space weather matters more than

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:58.420
most people realize. Solar flares and coronal mass ejections can fry satellites,

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:03.300
