00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:07.600
At the same time, our orbital neighborhood is getting seriously crowded with active satellites

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:12.960
to funk spacecraft and thousands of pieces of debris. These CubeSats will help strengthen the

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:17.360
United Kingdom's space domain awareness capabilities, giving them better eyes on both the natural

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:21.820
hazards and the growing traffic jam overhead. I'm always impressed by how smaller,

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:27.400
agile spacecraft like these CubeSats are becoming essential tools. They prove you don't always need

