00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:24.060
has just cooled its detectors to temperatures only a few thousandths of a degree above absolute zero.

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:30.100
That's hundreds of times colder than the vacuum of space. At those temperatures, the silicon and

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:35.000
