00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:05.340
science data and the possibilities are thrilling. If they detect something it could finally tell us

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:11.680
what makes up roughly 85% of the mass in the universe. If they detect nothing after years of running

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:16.920
that absence would be just as important forcing us to rethink our models of particle physics and cosmology.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:22.040
What strikes me most is the sheer audacity of the engineering maintaining those temperatures keeping

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:26.920
